    "name": "Havana Nha Trang Hotel",
    "detail": " I would certainly recommend the Havana Nha Trang Hotel to anyone wanting to stay on the beach in Nha Trang. The hotel itself is modern, clean, with luxurious rooms at a fraction of the price for similar hotels in the west. The access to the beach via an underground tunnel is priceless for avoiding the hectic Vietnam moto traffic. I would particularly like to comment on the dedicated service and friendliness of the staff. From the employee who checked us in, to the guest services representative who attended to our room while they (promptly) fixed an air conditioner problem, to the attendants on the beach, everyone was amazing. Look no further if you want a relaxing vacation in Nha Trang while still being close to the action in the city.",
