  {
    "hotel_id": "6508545",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/royal-hpm-hotel/hotel/nha-trang-vn.html",
    "name": "Royal HPM Hotel",
    "detail": "The room was a lot smaller than my expectation with the price for Nha Trang City and its location. It looked so different from the picture that was posted online. The location was so difficult to find, too. And it caused our grab drivers a lot of trouble for getting in because the alley is really small. The room was designed in an unexpecting way. The air conditioner was installed at the hidden corner and it blocks the airway of the air conditioner, which makes the air didn't come out as much as it could. The staff wasn't helpful and actively at all when I asked about having the extra fans or changing into another room because the a/c took so long to work on a 104 Fahrenheit day. And I did mention that I would like to pay more, but they forced us to stay and wait until the cool air come out. It actually took 2 hours for the cool air to fulfill the entire room. Probably this is one of my less favorite stay in Nha Trang. I do not recommend this hotel to family or friends, either.",
